WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:18.767
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:22.434
[fzzt]
WAAAH!

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:25.902
Well, this is different... maybe.

00:00:25.902 --> 00:00:27.377
Whoa!

00:00:27.377 --> 00:00:28.898
[crumbling]
WAH!

00:00:28.898 --> 00:00:31.551
Don't fall apart on me!

00:00:31.551 --> 00:00:32.567
[vortigaunt charges up]
Shit.

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:33.278
[vortigaunt charges up]
No...!

00:00:33.278 --> 00:00:34.948
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:00:34.948 --> 00:00:37.012
Oh, you want a piece of this, huh?!

00:00:37.012 --> 00:00:38.919
Well, I've got somethin' for ya!

00:00:38.919 --> 00:00:40.940
Here! Take some home with you!

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.900
There's too much happening here.
Trying to confuse me.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.395
YEAH, GET DOWN!

00:00:46.395 --> 00:00:47.996
GET DOWN!

00:00:47.996 --> 00:00:49.545
It's not even reacting.

00:00:49.545 --> 00:00:51.367
Yeah, keep your dist--Shit.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:57.541
THUD! Yeah, there you go!
That's more like it!

00:00:57.541 --> 00:01:01.650
What the hell are these things?
Pustules of the Damned.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.881
The land's rejecting the aliens!

00:01:03.881 --> 00:01:05.214
[vortigaunt charges up]
Which it should!

00:01:05.214 --> 00:01:06.268
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

00:01:06.268 --> 00:01:07.413
WAH!

00:01:07.413 --> 00:01:09.488
WUH-WAAAAAAH!

00:01:09.488 --> 00:01:10.567
More of them?!

00:01:11.394 --> 00:01:14.798
SPLAT! NOW THAT'S A GOOD ALIEN!

00:01:14.798 --> 00:01:18.565
Well, I will say this is better
than where I just came from,

00:01:18.565 --> 00:01:21.178
but that's not saying much.

00:01:21.178 --> 00:01:22.065
Wah!

00:01:22.065 --> 00:01:27.054
I don't even understand how a small
island could support something that big.

00:01:27.054 --> 00:01:27.968
What's in there?

00:01:28.712 --> 00:01:29.773
WAA-AAA!

00:01:29.773 --> 00:01:32.194
IT TRIED TO SUCK ME IN!

00:01:32.194 --> 00:01:34.450
Well, as the only zoning inspector here,

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:37.671
I'm condemning this property
as a safety hazard.

00:01:37.671 --> 00:01:40.422
You can file any complaints at my office.

00:01:40.422 --> 00:01:42.976
I'm hearing troub--oh, wow, a cave.

00:01:42.976 --> 00:01:45.439
This ecosystem IS interesting.

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:46.718
[vortigaunt charging up]
Shut up.

00:01:46.718 --> 00:01:50.628
You're not on the Science Team.
I don't care what you have to say.

00:01:50.628 --> 00:01:54.490
What, is that your buddy? Like the two of
you were going to convince me of something?

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.889
I'm a scientist with a shotgun.
I'm unstoppable.

00:01:57.889 --> 00:01:59.318
Neee!

00:01:59.318 --> 00:02:03.644
Well, this is smaller but it's about
as good as the last apartment.

00:02:03.644 --> 00:02:05.121
It's darker.

00:02:05.121 --> 00:02:07.735
Guess it's just going to have to do.

00:02:07.735 --> 00:02:10.149
What the hell is that? A spore?

00:02:10.149 --> 00:02:11.784
Well, that can't be healthy.

00:02:11.784 --> 00:02:15.174
Maybe it'll be better if
I can drain the... floor.

00:02:15.174 --> 00:02:16.220
What's this?

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:18.801
Oh, a basement! Let's take a look.

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:22.603
Yeah, I'm going to have to clean this up.

00:02:22.603 --> 00:02:26.828
Y'know, if I had known my next
apartment was going to look like this--

00:02:26.828 --> 00:02:30.401
well, first off, I'd be very confused
and would mostly want to know

00:02:30.401 --> 00:02:34.133
what I needed to do with my life
in order to make this not happen,

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:36.338
and I don't think I'd have an answer.

00:02:36.338 --> 00:02:39.457
I mean, what was I supposed
to do? Turn down Black Mesa?

00:02:39.457 --> 00:02:43.906
Oh, yeah! I'll just go work at
ANOTHER well-funded facility

00:02:43.906 --> 00:02:48.736
looking for PURE physics
work--theoretical, no less.

00:02:48.736 --> 00:02:51.901
Hup, we've got a bit of an infestation.

00:02:53.002 --> 00:02:55.991
Can't say I'm surprised.

00:02:55.991 --> 00:03:00.166
Oh, I should reload. I forgot I
took some goodies from that canister.

00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:03.200
Yeah, that was really crazy, wasn't it?

00:03:04.815 --> 00:03:06.689
I mean, how did that thing even eat?

00:03:06.689 --> 00:03:10.050
There weren't enough...
things there to sustain it.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:13.069
Maybe it extracted
something from the air?

00:03:13.069 --> 00:03:16.000
Oh-OH! Not again! NOT AGAIN!

00:03:16.652 --> 00:03:18.588
Okay, well it blocked the exit--

00:03:18.588 --> 00:03:22.672
[coughing, spluttering]

00:03:22.672 --> 00:03:24.011
Okay, well--

00:03:24.011 --> 00:03:30.225
[spluttering]

00:03:30.225 --> 00:03:31.515
Blah!

00:03:31.515 --> 00:03:34.196
Well, the shower fucking sucks.

00:03:34.196 --> 00:03:36.736
Yeah, this is...

00:03:36.736 --> 00:03:39.354
I shouldn't be breathing any of this.

00:03:39.354 --> 00:03:42.263
It needs to be purified with fire,

00:03:42.263 --> 00:03:44.635
[teleportation sound]
but I don't really have the equipment

00:03:44.635 --> 00:03:45.964
[bullsquid spit]
to handle--

00:03:45.964 --> 00:03:47.734
OH, YOU SQUATTER ASSHOLE!

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:52.824
YEAH! THANKS! I WAS HOPING TO
GET THAT TASTE OUT OF MY MOUTH!

00:03:52.824 --> 00:03:54.822
[spluttering, spitting]

00:03:54.822 --> 00:03:55.667
Bluh!

00:03:56.934 --> 00:03:59.928
Oh, hey, another one of these canisters.

00:03:59.928 --> 00:04:04.959
Yeah! Some grenade rounds,
Magnum b-- Well, I'm glad it IS here.

00:04:04.959 --> 00:04:07.037
Hey, you know what I think happened?

00:04:07.037 --> 00:04:10.450
I bet we REALLY fucked up with
the teleporter initially,

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.757
and it scattered everything everywhere.

00:04:12.757 --> 00:04:17.085
Like his ammo is here and his
head is floating out in space,

00:04:17.085 --> 00:04:19.238
his legs somewhere else...

00:04:19.238 --> 00:04:21.157
Whoa! What's this?

00:04:21.157 --> 00:04:24.386
It's like an... unholy dumbwaiter.

00:04:24.386 --> 00:04:27.790
I bet it would make a funny
sound if I ran a stick alongside it.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:30.420
So, how do I operate--OH!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:33.014
THAT ALMOST TOOK MY HEAD CLEAN OFF!

00:04:33.014 --> 00:04:35.353
Wait, no!
That would've taken it off sloppy!

00:04:35.353 --> 00:04:37.684
It would've popped from the
sheer pressure!

00:04:37.684 --> 00:04:38.637
Whew!

00:04:38.637 --> 00:04:40.729
Okay, I get it...

00:04:40.729 --> 00:04:43.588
This is the servants' entrance,

00:04:43.588 --> 00:04:47.992
so once I learn how to domesticate these
bastards, this might come in useful.

00:04:47.992 --> 00:04:53.015
Although that's a big assumption that
I even CAN domesticate these freaks.

00:04:53.015 --> 00:04:55.100
Okay, uh...

00:04:56.582 --> 00:04:57.601
I don't get it.

00:04:59.327 --> 00:05:01.760
Why is it taking so long this time?

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.691
Oh, that's it--Wait, no! That's too fast!

00:05:03.691 --> 00:05:04.968
I can't get dAAAH!

00:05:05.599 --> 00:05:08.403
AAAH! AAAAH! AAAAH!

00:05:08.403 --> 00:05:11.168
OH MY GOD, I'M TOO HIGH!

00:05:11.168 --> 00:05:14.162
NO! STOP THAT! I CAN'T KEEP MY BALANCE!

00:05:14.162 --> 00:05:16.161
WAAAAAAAAA!

00:05:16.161 --> 00:05:18.425
Oh shit! Oh shit!

00:05:18.425 --> 00:05:20.823
Okay! Deep breaths!

00:05:20.823 --> 00:05:22.941
[gasping]

00:05:22.941 --> 00:05:27.244
I DO belong on a pedestal, but
metaphorically, God dammit!

00:05:27.244 --> 00:05:28.901
Hyaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:33.499
Okay, this is a LOT better, lot
better. Now I'm a little lower...

00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:36.725
and I can move my feet
more than four inches.

00:05:36.725 --> 00:05:37.762
Just like that.

00:05:37.762 --> 00:05:42.227
I could sleep here if I wanted to.
Though, I really don't want to do that.

00:05:42.227 --> 00:05:45.256
My life is all about
adjusting expectations.

00:05:45.256 --> 00:05:48.934
Like, I might think I'm upset about
something, but then I'm falling to my death,

00:05:48.934 --> 00:05:54.639
or having my face bit off, and then
I'm getting shot or frozen or drowned...

00:05:54.639 --> 00:05:57.768
It's just this big merry-go-round
of a new horrible crisis

00:05:57.768 --> 00:05:59.901
taking my mind off the last one.

00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:04.134
So, I might think, oh I have it bad
now, but it's ALL been bad.

00:06:04.134 --> 00:06:06.831
Nothing's worse, it's just different.

00:06:06.831 --> 00:06:08.200
I'm going for it. Hup!

00:06:09.037 --> 00:06:10.266
WAAAH!

00:06:10.266 --> 00:06:12.055
Hoo, that was good.

00:06:12.055 --> 00:06:13.724
What's that island over there?

00:06:13.724 --> 00:06:16.802
It's glowing.
Therefore, it must be important.

00:06:16.802 --> 00:06:19.577
I think that's how the
hierarchy works around here.

00:06:19.577 --> 00:06:22.167
Whatever glows has more status.

00:06:22.167 --> 00:06:23.549
Maybe it's a teleporter.

00:06:23.549 --> 00:06:26.771
Y'know, that's kind of
nice in an awful way?

00:06:26.771 --> 00:06:30.769
I keep finding teleporters from
one alien hell to the next.

00:06:30.769 --> 00:06:35.911
Like the last one was horrible,
but the first one wasn't... that bad?

00:06:35.911 --> 00:06:39.292
Oh, wait, that had the quake.
That was awful, too.

00:06:39.292 --> 00:06:40.434
Okay...

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:43.583
Woo!

00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:46.208
Yeah, that other island probably
doesn't exist now.

00:06:46.208 --> 00:06:47.933
[vortigaunt charging up, bolt]
Uh, take cover!

00:06:47.933 --> 00:06:49.500
Who's shooting at me?

00:06:51.085 --> 00:06:54.000
[vortigaunt bolt]
Wow, this guy's motivated, huh?

00:06:55.832 --> 00:06:59.456
Oh! That was an amazing shot!

00:06:59.456 --> 00:07:02.722
I'm not even sure I can
claim skill on that one.

00:07:02.722 --> 00:07:06.098
That's fate making up for all this shit.

00:07:06.098 --> 00:07:08.335
But, yeah, it's an interesting dilemma,

00:07:08.335 --> 00:07:12.334
though I'd RATHER see it as a
thought exercise and not LIVE IT!

00:07:13.497 --> 00:07:19.172
Hoo! So, if that is a teleporter,
do I go in it and risk a worse hell,

00:07:19.172 --> 00:07:21.246
or just stay here with the hell I know?

00:07:21.246 --> 00:07:25.559
It could take me straight into the
stomach of another god spider thing.

00:07:25.559 --> 00:07:28.450
How did that exist?
There wasn't enough food.

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.757
Maybe it ate space krill.

00:07:30.757 --> 00:07:32.033
Hoo!

00:07:33.441 --> 00:07:34.094
[vortigaunt bolt]

00:07:34.094 --> 00:07:37.757
Are you kidding me?
I thought I got all of them.

00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:39.601
GO! BACK! TO--!

00:07:40.466 --> 00:07:42.719
Where the hell did you
come from, anyway?

00:07:42.719 --> 00:07:46.969
Oh, shit! The island must be birthing
them! That's what those red pits are!

00:07:46.969 --> 00:07:48.951
Oh, I've got to get out of here, then.

00:07:48.951 --> 00:07:52.369
I can't stay in THIS hell.
I'll have to watch my back forever.

00:07:52.369 --> 00:07:56.356
Oh!, I could try and ride
the manta rays. Sure.

00:07:56.356 --> 00:07:57.238
What's that quote?

00:07:57.238 --> 00:08:01.482
Insanity is doing the same thing over and
over again and expecting different results?

00:08:01.482 --> 00:08:06.035
Well, one: it's a stupid saying because
it doesn't account for other variables.

00:08:06.035 --> 00:08:07.912
Look at slot machines.

00:08:07.912 --> 00:08:11.518
And, two: that implies
everything is not insane.

00:08:11.518 --> 00:08:13.927
[fzzt]

